<title>UK: TABLE-Reuters H1 pretax profit down 3 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Reuters H1 pretax profit down 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.2		  vs  14.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  3.1		  vs   2.75</p>
<p> Pretax			333		  vs   342</p>
<p> Turnover		  1,409		  vs 1,438</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 335 and 342 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Reuters Holdings Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
